FILE:.changeset/bold-stars-grab.md
---
---

Record internal production-reachability cleanup with no package release.
FILE:.changeset/bright-dates-report.md
---
"@taxkit/core": major
"@taxkit/rules-au-income-tax": major
"@taxkit/rules-au-pay": major
"@taxkit/calculators": patch
"@taxkit/api-http": patch
"@taxkit/sdk": patch
---

Validate ISO dates as real Gregorian calendar dates, expose exact independent
Australian ruleset versions in calculation reports, and prevent rejected input
values or raw Effect causes from appearing in public calculator and SDK errors.
FILE:.changeset/calm-runs-prove.md
---
---

Record the internal release-readiness proof chain, immutable receipts and
non-executing presentation boundary without publishing a private package.
FILE:.changeset/fresh-workers-render.md
---
"@taxkit/docs-content": patch
---

Make bundled documentation navigation available without request-time filesystem
access so the docs application can render in Cloudflare Workers.
FILE:.changeset/quiet-docs-own.md
---
"@taxkit/docs-content": patch
"@taxkit/docs-fumadocs": patch
---

Move authored TaxKit MDX, navigation and checked examples into the content
package, and replace callback-shaped Fumadocs loading with a schema-decoded
Effect service and deterministic Layers.
